  <name>Jot</name>
  <summary>Plain-file notes for Linux</summary>

  <description>
    <p>
      Jot is a Markdown notes app for Linux. Notes are plain files in a folder you choose, and
      sync is optional: none, a folder another tool already syncs, S3, Dropbox or Google Drive.
    </p>
    <p>
      Jot is at an early stage. It shares its look and its themes with Callie, the calendar from
      the same makers.
    </p>
  </description>

